    "file": "../artifacts/01-kindred-direct-public-page.md",
    "content": "# 01: Kindred Direct Public Page\n\n## Metadata\n\n- Source type: platform page\n- Platform: Kindred Direct\n- Captured: 18 April 2035\n- Status: public marketing page\n\n## Artifact\n\nNo one should wait alone.\n\nKindred Direct provides responsive care support for families, workers, students, elders, and people moving through grief, stress, transition, and daily overwhelm.\n\nEvery Kindred member receives:\n\n- 24/7 companion response\n- daily check-ins\n- medication and appointment reminders\n- grief and anxiety support\n- family liaison tools\n- escalation routing when additional support is appropriate\n\nOur care companions are trained on clinically reviewed guidance, member preferences, and verified safety protocols. Human Plus members receive expanded access to verified human-origin support, including live listener sessions and human-written continuity notes.\n\nKindred is not a replacement for emergency services. Kindred is the layer before crisis becomes crisis.\n\nYou should not have to earn being answered.\n\n## Investigator Notes\n\nThe page uses moral language against waiting, then quietly separates ordinary support from verified human-origin contact.\n\n\"Human Plus\" is presented as expansion, not rationing.\n\n"
