    "file": "../artifacts/06-plan-comparison-grid.md",
    "content": "# 06: Plan Comparison Grid\n\n## Metadata\n\n- Source type: pricing grid\n- Source: Kindred Direct partner portal\n- Captured: 21 April 2035\n- Status: leaked screenshot transcription\n\n## Artifact\n\n### Municipal Basic\n\nMonthly sponsor cost per member: 18 credits\n\n- synthetic companion: unlimited\n- response window: under 60 seconds\n- human-origin contact: emergency threshold only\n- family liaison: automated digest\n- escalation review: batch processed\n- sponsor report: aggregate engagement only\n- continuity memory: companion-generated\n\n### Employer Standard\n\nMonthly sponsor cost per member: 42 credits\n\n- synthetic companion: unlimited\n- response window: under 30 seconds\n- human-origin contact: one monthly listener session\n- family liaison: automated plus human review\n- escalation review: next business day\n- sponsor report: trend summary\n- continuity memory: companion-generated with human audit\n\n### Human Plus\n\nMonthly sponsor cost per member: 119 credits\n\n- synthetic companion: unlimited\n- response window: under 15 seconds\n- human-origin contact: priority live listener access\n- human-written continuity notes\n- licensed care escalation review\n- family liaison with named human coordinator\n- sponsor report: high-touch concern review\n- continuity memory: human-authored\n\n### Executive Family\n\nMonthly sponsor cost per household: custom\n\n- dedicated human coordinator\n- proactive concern monitoring\n- emergency concierge escalation\n- reputation-sensitive privacy handling\n\n## Investigator Notes\n\nThe platform answers everyone quickly.\n\nWhat changes by price is not speed alone. It is whether a human is allowed into the loop.\n\nThe grid turns presence into infrastructure: memory, review, escalation, and family contact all become tiered.\n"
